<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Strayer Education cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Strayer Education cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it reduced its intermediate-term rating on Strayer Education Inc to market performer from outperformer, based on valuation.</p>
<p>EVEREN said it is maintaining its long-term outperformer rating on the stock.</p>
<p>EVEREN said the computer training and education company share price has reached its six-month price target.</p>
<p>Strayer closed off 5/8 at 33.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
